WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
I'm looking around now to find out what's right

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,200
On the one hand, you have to inquire about what's going on over there.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,520
On the other hand, take advantage of this time

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,440
We recruit troops

5
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,320
Let's recruit troops and buy horses

6
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,200
There are still many people around Shazhou City

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,440
I'm now trying to find a way to bring food in for us here.

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,120
I will also get other things at the same time.

9
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,880
You bring friendship to the stragglers around you and the people

10
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,440
They all got us into Shazhou City.

11
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,240
If there is food and drink, they will be willing to come in.

12
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,880
And don’t think they’ve backed down now.

13
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,320
We can sit back and relax

14
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,200
I just don't know when they will make a comeback.

15
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,920
We have to train our troops well in another aspect

16
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,880
Find a way to go east and contact the court.

17
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:29,800
It’s best to get in touch

18
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,280
Let the imperial court cooperate with us in sending reinforcements.

19
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,240
But our east

20
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,200
I've also had them cut off, I know

21
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,400
But no matter what, I have to find a way to get in touch.

22
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,900
ok general

23
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,700
This is pork, it tastes so good

24
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,700
You see it’s all oil

25
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,460
Definitely if General Xiao gets it back for us

26
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,780
We have to thank General Xiao

27
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:46,660
You need to make more money

28
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:49,380
It’s okay to improve everyone’s lives for the better

29
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,260
That's how you have to be general

30
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:53,100
Otherwise, I'll try it first. Are you?

31
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,100
You'd better not try

32
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,420
I lost my hair twice and got pitted.
